                  </p>
                </div>

                <div class="sr-kc">
                  <h3>Field · one rule, two states</h3>
                  <div class="sr-field-row">
                    <label for="sr-email">Where should we reach you?</label>
                    <input class="sr-input" id="sr-email" type="email" placeholder="you@somewhere.com" aria-invalid="true" aria-describedby="sr-email-err" />
                    <p class="sr-field-err" id="sr-email-err">
